WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.270
- The first time,

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:03.773
when I was very little,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.880
we were in Houston.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.280
Yes, I think it was Houston.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.812
And at some point,

00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:12.300
they have such good food.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.270
But at some point,

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.160
we were craving tacos.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.100
And it was one of the
first times that we went.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.300
I was still very young.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.253
And we saw Taco Bell, you know?

00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:23.086
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:23.086 --> 00:00:24.820
And let's go get some tacos.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.130
And can we have two meat tacos?

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.423
And our English was not very well.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.600
And they gave us the shell tacos.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.080
I've never seen that in my life.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.694
They don't exist in Mexico.

00:00:35.694 --> 00:00:37.460
It's always with the soft tortilla.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.457
And we're like, "No, no, no."

00:00:39.457 --> 00:00:40.817
"We want tacos."

00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:41.657
"And yeah, this is."

00:00:41.657 --> 00:00:43.050
"No, tacos, no."

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.277
And we're asking each other,

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.114
"How do you say tacos in English?"

00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:46.947
(Kelly and the audience laugh)

00:00:46.947 --> 00:00:49.260
I don't know the name of
the place is Taco Bell.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.093
And I'm like,

00:00:50.093 --> 00:00:52.157
"Okay, taco, taco, taquito."

00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:54.066
"You roll it." (munching)

00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:54.969
"This is hard."

00:00:54.969 --> 00:00:55.802
"It's not like this."

00:00:55.802 --> 00:00:56.727
"No taco. This is no taco."

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.670
And turns out, that's a Texan taco.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.210
- It's,
- [Salma] That, you know.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.580
- Yes.
- [Salma] Like Tex-Mex taco.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:05.413
- Tex-Mex.

